  "description": "Alleppy Coir refers to the Coir products made in Ambalappuzha and Cherthala Taluks of Alappuzha district, in the state of Kerala, India. Coir production in this region dates back to as early as 1859. The World Trade Organization (WTO) granted Geographical Indication status to \"Alleppey Coir\" in 2007.",
